      "writtenOn": "2026-09-18T10:36:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I took one more look at the usage of `PluginItemContext` vs direct usage of the `DynamicItem` and, in my opinion, the `PluginItemContext` gives us almost nothing over `DynamicItem`. Further, we have to use a lambda expression with the `PluginItemContext` which is a little awkward compared to the direct usage of `DynamicItem` which would be:\n```\n  lockManager.get().getLock(CoreLockKeys.REDUCE_MAX_AUTH_TOKEN_LIFETIME);\n```\n\nTherefore, my suggestion is to use `DynamicItem\u003cLockManager\u003e`. Also change the existing usage of `PluginItemContext` in the `CreateProject` to `DynamicItem`.",
      "revId": "af91d388bd172f38a3b526a0ba92ef19f2577086",
